%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: MziaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Hello, dear. Here are my papers, kept them under my Bible so they
      wouldn't wrinkle. Mzia Kakulia. Southern block, fourth floor. Thirty-one
      years there.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I work as a seamstress, from home mostly. People still bring me things
      to mend. In times like these, mending matters more than new.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What do people bring you?
      npcResponse: Coats, mostly. And socks. You wouldn't believe how many people
        forget spare socks when things go wrong.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: Do you work alone?
      npcResponse: My granddaughter Irina lives with me now. She helps when her
        hands aren't shaking. Which they do, lately. I don't say anything.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
  - type: 0
    npcLine: My husband helps at the bakery on weekends, a good steady man. I'm
      going home to finish a sweater, bright red, for my grandson. You look thin,
      dear. Are they feeding you at this post?
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I have a pot of soup at home if you want it later. I always make
      too much. Permit's here, November expiry. Everything in order.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: That's very kind of you.
      npcResponse: I've outlived two husbands and one very bad winter. Kindness
        is cheaper than medicine and it lasts longer.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: You don't need to worry about me.
      npcResponse: Mm. I'll worry anyway. Keeps my hands busy when the knitting
        runs out.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
